--- !u!114 &617174822
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 617174820}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "SELLING/BUYING\r\n\r\nDuring Level 2, cars can be bought at the current
    price at the beginning of each turn (Only 1 car per turn). \r\nAfter each full
    round (all players had their turn), everyone has the option to sell one of their
    cars.\r\n\r\nAfter the final race, all players can sell up to 3 more cars.\r\n\r\nTOYNOPOLIES\r\n\r\nIn
    Level 2, as soon as a single player is the exclusive owner of a car type, the
    Player has a \"Toynopoly\" on that car. They now have the option to protect the
    car, so no one will be able to buy it anymore. The protection can't be enabled
    for more than 1 car.\n\r\nHowever, the value of a protected car can still be
    changed by other players as described in the \"Time Battle\" rule.  The Toynopoly
    owner can also choose this car during their turn and try to buff its value, according
    to the \"Time Battle\" rule. In this case, the result will be:\r\nGap to winner
    in seconds substracted from the car value.\r\nGap to last finisher in seconds
    added to the car value.\r\n \r\nDIVIDENDS\r\n\r\nDuring Level 2, each car will
    pay a dividend once, at a random moment. Each owner will immediately get the
    dividend in cash, according to the number of cars owned and the car value.\r\n\r\nEND\r\n\r\nLevel
    2 ends after 10 races in a 5-player match, and after 12 races with 2-4 players.\r\nPlayer
    with highest cash wins the match and will become Toynopoly Champion. \r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: af17111b7c862414b9b0a68fc902f709, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 7486160777593221014, guid: af17111b7c862414b9b0a68fc902f709, type: 2}
