  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "level 2\r\n\r\nThe goal now is earning as much cash as possible with your
    cars. General gameplay is the same as in level one. The active player picks a
    car / track combination. However, players can now only choose cars they own.\r\n\r\nCHALLENGES\r\n\r\nWhen
    it's your turn, you can choose a car you own and challenge one of the other owners
    of the car. If you finish ahead of them, you receive one of their cars, if they
    beat you, you lose one of your cars to them. \r\n\r\nTIME BATTLE\r\n\r\nIn Level
    2, the winner of each race can also manipulate the car prices: \n\r\nIf the active
    player is the winner, they get the seconds finished ahead of the person they
    challenged as a bonus. They can add/substract that amount from any car price
    (with a maximum of +/-20).\r\n\r\nIf someone else is the winner (\"stolen win\"),
    they receive the seconds finished ahead of the active player.\r\n\r\nOnly full
    seconds count, there is no rounding up or down. \r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: af17111b7c862414b9b0a68fc902f709, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 7486160777593221014, guid: af17111b7c862414b9b0a68fc902f709, type: 2}
